# Medical Policy Determination
library "Medical Policy Determination".

// Communicated results for the individual procedure assessed in the L34194 example.

activity "certify.Met":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `The assessed procedure meets the functional-surgery criteria represented in this example.`.

activity "not-certify.Unmet":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `The assessed procedure does not meet the functional-surgery criteria represented in this example.`.
